w inspecting or updating %d total posts'=>'现在正在检查或更新 %d 个帖子','%1$d/%2$d: Inspecting the post %3$d'=>'%1$d/%2$d: 正在检查帖子 %3$d','Creating author term for the user %d'=>'为用户 %d 创建作者术语','Adding the author term %1$d to the post %2$d'=>'将作者术语 %1$d 添加到帖子 %2$d','All is set. No posts need to be updated'=>'一切设置就绪。无需更新帖子','Configure'=>'配置','Please correct your form errors below and try again.'=>'请在下面纠正您的表单错误，然后重试。','Cheatin&#8217; uh?'=>'作弊&#8217; 嗯？','You do not have necessary permissions to complete this action.'=>'您没有必要的权限来完成此操作。','Post does not exist'=>'帖子不存在','No author term'=>'没有作者术语','"post_author" is empty'=>'“post_author”为空','Drag-and-drop Authors to add them to the %s category'=>'拖放作者以将其添加到 %s 类别','Search for an author'=>'搜索作者','This option is showing because you do not have a WordPress user selected as an author. For some tasks, it can be helpful to have a user selected here. This user will not be visible on the front of your site.'=>'此选项显示是因为您没有选择 WordPress 用户作为作者。对于某些任务，选择一个用户可能会很有帮助。此用户在您网站的前端不可见。','Search for an user'=>'搜索用户','Author Box'=>'作者框','Default Author Box'=>'默认作者框','Hide Author Box'=>'隐藏作者框','Filter posts by author'=>'按作者过滤帖子','Remove %s'=>'移除 %s','New author added.'=>'新作者已添加。','Author profile deleted.'=>'作者资料已删除。','Author profile updated.'=>'作者资料已更新。','Error adding author account.'=>'添加作者帐户时出错。','Error updating author profile.'=>'更新作者资料时出错。','Authors deleted.'=>'作者已删除。','Author URL'=>'作者 URL','Co-Authors Plus must be installed and active.'=>'必须安装并激活 Co-Authors Plus。','Read more.'=>'阅读更多。','The results could not be loaded.'=>'无法加载结果。','Please delete %d character'=>'请删除 %d 个字符','Please delete %d characters'=>'请删除 %d 个字符','Please enter %d or more character'=>'请输入 %d 个或更多字符','Please enter %d or more characters'=>'请输入 %d 个或更多字符','Loading more results...'=>'正在加载更多结果...','You can only select %d item'=>'您只能选择 %d 个项目','You can only select %d items'=>'您只能选择 %d 个项目','No results found'=>'未找到结果','Searching...'=>'搜索中...','Remove all items'=>'移除所有项目','No results match'=>'没有匹配的结果','Need PublishPress Authors Support?'=>'需要 PublishPress 作者支持吗？','If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.'=>'如果您需要帮助或有新的功能请求，请告诉我们。','Request Support'=>'请求支持','Detailed documentation is also available on the plugin website.'=>'插件网站上也提供详细文档。','View Knowledge Base'=>'查看知识库','Text'=>'文本','Multiline text'=>'多行文本','WYSIWYG Editor'=>'所见即所得编辑器','Link'=>'链接','Email address'=>'电子邮件地址','Active'=>'活跃','Disabled'=>'禁用','Optional'=>'可选','Required'=>'必填','No'=>'否','Yes, this is a Social Profile'=>'是的，这是一个社交资料','Select an option'=>'选择一个选项','dofollow'=>'dofollow','nofollow'=>'nofollow','Discover authors, categories and boxes for a post byline'=>'发现作者、类别和帖子副本的框','Read paginated existing author term IDs and enabled author categories plus native Author Box choices for one editable post. Uses byline permissions rather than granting profile management. Never creates profiles for unassigned WordPress users. Follow each list total_pages separately.'=>'读取分页的现有作者术语 ID 和启用的作者类别，以及一个可编辑帖子的本地作者框选项。使用副本权限而不是授予资料管理。永远不会为未分配的 WordPress 用户创建资料。分别跟踪每个列表的 total_pages。','Read post authors and Author Box'=>'读取帖子作者和作者框','Read exact ordered author term IDs, author-category assignments, fallback WordPress author and per-post Author Box with a revision hash. Requires native byline and edit_post permissions; never guesses author IDs or writes during reads.'=>'读取确切排序的作者术语 ID、作者-类别分配、后备 WordPress 作者和每个帖子的作者框及修订哈希。需要本地副本和 edit_post 权限；在读取期间永远不会猜测作者 ID 或写入。','Update post authors and Author Box'=>'更新帖子作者和作者框','Replace a post byline with ordered author_ids, or patch category assignments and its Author Box. Omitted fields are preserved. Requires the latest hash and an enabled post type. dry_run previews without saving. Discover authors, categories and native layout choices first.'=>'用排序的 author_ids 替换帖子的副本，或修补类别分配及其作者框。省略的字段将被保留。需要最新的哈希和启用的帖子类型。dry_run 预览不保存。首先发现作者、类别和本地布局选项。','Update bylines on multiple posts'=>'在多个帖子上更新副本','Apply explicit per-post byline changes after validating every object, revision hash and author/category identifier. Each change has its own post_id and expected_hash. dry_run previews all targets without saving. On failure, prior writes are compensated with their original bylines.'=>'在验证每个对象、修订哈希和作者/类别标识符后，应用显式的每个帖子的副本更改。每个更改都有其自己的 post_id 和 expected_hash。dry_run 预览所有目标而不保存。在失败时，先前的写入将以其原始副本进行补偿。','Choose a post type enabled for Authors.'=>'选择一个启用了作者的帖子类型。','The post byline changed. Read it again before saving.'=>'帖子副本已更改。保存之前请再次读取。','Choose existing author term IDs.'=>'选择现有作者术语 ID。','Empty bylines must first be enabled in Authors settings.'=>'空副本必须首先在作者设置中启用。','Category assignments must refer to the selected authors.'=>'类别分配必须指向所选作者。','Multiple author categories are disabled.'=>'多个作者类别被禁用。','Choose an enabled author category available for this post type.'=>'选择一个可用于该帖子类型的启用作者类别。','An empty byline preserves its existing fallback WordPress author.'=>'空副本保留其现有的后备 WordPress 作者。','Choose an existing fallback WordPress user.'=>'选择一个现有的后备 WordPress 用户。','Choose an available Author Box and enable per-post box selection.'=>'选择一个可用的作者框并启用每个帖子的框选择。','The byline save failed and its original state could not be restored. Read the post before retrying.'=>'副本保存失败，无法恢复其原始状态。在重试之前请读取帖子。','Could not save the complete post byline.'=>'无法保存完整的帖子副本。','Include each post only once in a batch.'=>'在批处理中每个帖子只能包含一次。','The batch failed and some original bylines could not be restored. Read all target posts before retrying.'=>'批处理失败，某些原始副本无法恢复。在重试之前请读取所有目标帖子。','List Author Categories'=>'列出作者类别','Read native author category IDs, singular/plural names, order, enabled state and schema settings. These group a post byline and differ from post categories. Pro adds per-post-type targeting. Results are paginated.'=>'读取本地作者类别 ID、单数/复数名称、顺序、启用状态和模式设置。这些将一个帖子副本分组，并且与帖子类别不同。Pro 版本提供每个帖子类型的目标。结果是分页的。','Discover Author Category fields'=>'发现作者类别字段','Read category identifiers, label and grouping settings, and active-edition targeting choices. Categories describe author byline roles such as Writer or Reviewer, not WordPress post categories.'=>'读取类别标识符、标签和分组设置，以及活动版本的目标选择。类别描述作者副本角色，例如作家或评论员，而不是 WordPress 帖子类别。','Read Author Category'=>'读取作者类别','Read one verified native author category and revision hash. Use this hash when updating or deleting.'=>'读取一个经过验证的本地作者类别和修订哈希。更新或删除时使用此哈希。','Create or update Author Category'=>'创建或更新作者类别','Create a category with category_name and plural_name or patch an existing ID using expected_hash. Preserves omitted fields, validates post types and requires Pro for post-type targeting. dry_run previews without saving. Category order is an integer position.'=>'使用 category_name 和 plural_name 创建类别，或使用 expected_hash 修补现有 ID。保留省略的字段，验证帖子类型，并需要 Pro 进行帖子类型目标。dry_run 预览而不保存。类别顺序是整数位置。','Delete unused Author Category'=>'删除未使用的作者类别','Delete an unused native category and its metadata. Existing post category relationships or author-profile defaults must be reassigned first. Requires expected_hash; dry_run checks without deleting.'=>'删除未使用的本地类别及其元数据。现有的帖子类别关系或作者资料默认值必须首先重新分配。需要 expected_hash；dry_run 检查而不删除。','Singular name'=>'单数名称','Plural name'=>'复数名称','Schema property'=>'模式属性','Author Category not found.'=>'未找到作者分类。','The category changed. Read it again before saving.'=>'分类已更改。请在保存之前重新阅读。','Use exact category field types from discovery.'=>'使用从发现中获取的确切分类字段类型。','Singular and plural category names are required.'=>'单数和复数分类名称是必需的。','Category post-type targeting requires Authors Pro.'=>'分类帖子类型定位需要 Authors Pro。','Choose registered post types.'=>'选择注册的帖子类型。','An Author Category with this slug already exists.'=>'具有此别名的作者分类已存在。','Could not save the native Author Category.'=>'无法保存本机作者分类。','The category save failed; the original state was restored.'=>'分类保存失败；已恢复到原始状态。','The category save failed and restoration was incomplete. Read it before retrying.'=>'分类保存失败，恢复不完整。请在重试之前阅读。','The category changed. Read it again before deleting.'=>'分类已更改。请在删除之前重新阅读。','Reassign category references before deleting.'=>'在删除之前重新分配分类引用。','The category could not be deleted.'=>'无法删除该分类。','Use the exact native field type shown in discovery.'=>'使用发现中显示的确切本机字段类型。','Choose a list of values from field discovery.'=>'从字段发现中选择值列表。','Field choice lists require string values from discovery.'=>'字段选择列表需要来自发现的字符串值。','Box shortcodes require parallel lists of shortcode and position strings.'=>'盒子短代码需要并行的短代码和位置字符串列表。','Box shortcodes require string values.'=>'盒子短代码需要字符串值。','Each box shortcode needs one matching position.'=>'每个盒子短代码需要一个匹配位置。','The native field sanitizer is unavailable.'=>'本机字段清理程序不可用。','List saved Author Lists'=>'保存的作者列表','Read a bounded page of saved Author List presets. Each preset has its own ID and shortcode. This is configuration, not a list of author profiles. Includes native active/trash status.'=>'读取保存的作者列表预设的有限页。每个预设都有自己的 ID 和短代码。这是配置，而不是作者档案列表。包括本机活动/垃圾状态。','Read saved Author List'=>'读取保存的作者列表','Read one verified list preset, its shortcode and revision hash. Editing a list does not change author profiles, post bylines or Author Boxes.'=>'读取一个经过验证的列表预设、其短代码和修订哈希。编辑列表不会更改作者档案、帖子署名或作者框。','Discover Author List fields'=>'发现作者列表字段','Read native layout, display-field, grouping, image, filter and active-edition search/pagination choices. Pro-only controls appear only with Pro active; promotional controls are excluded.'=>'读取本机布局、显示字段、分组、图像、过滤器和活动版的搜索/分页选择。仅在 Pro 处于活动状态时显示专业控制；促销控件被排除。','Create or update Author List'=>'创建或更新作者列表','Create a list with native title and layout fields, or patch a verified preset using its latest hash. Generates a native publishpress_authors_list shortcode from validated fields. Preserves omitted fields and other lists. Use status active to restore a trashed preset. dry_run previews without saving.'=>'使用本机标题和布局字段创建列表，或使用其最新哈希修补经过验证的预设。从验证的字段生成本机 publishpress_authors_list 短代码。保留省略的字段和其他列表。使用状态活动来恢复已删除的预设。dry_run 预览而不保存。','Trash or delete Author List'=>'垃圾或删除作者列表','Trash a verified saved list, or explicitly use permanent true to remove its preset. Requires the latest hash. Does not delete posts or author profiles. dry_run checks without saving.'=>'将经过验证的保存列表放入垃圾中，或明确使用永久 true 来删除其预设。需要最新哈希。不会删除帖子或作者档案。dry_run 检查而不保存。','Author List not found.'=>'未找到作者列表。','The Author List changed. Read it again before saving.'=>'作者列表已更改。请在保存之前重新阅读。','An Author List requires a title and native layout.'=>'作者列表需要标题和本机布局。','The Author List changed. Read it again before deleting.'=>'作者列表已更改。请在删除之前重新阅读。','List Author Boxes'=>'列出作者框','Read Author Box'=>'读取作者框','Discover Author Box fields'=>'发现作者框字段','Save Author Box'=>'保存作者框','Trash Author Box'=>'删除作者框','List author field definitions'=>'列出作者字段定义','Read author field definition'=>'读取作者字段定义','Discover custom field options'=>'发现自定义字段选项','Save author field definition'=>'保存作者字段定义','Trash author field definition'=>'删除作者字段定义','New boxes only: choose a native Free or Pro template from field discovery.'=>'仅限新框：从字段发现中选择一个本地的免费或专业模板。','List a bounded page of native objects with IDs, titles, slugs and status. Only editable objects are returned. Read the exact object and its field schema before editing. Follow total_pages even if permissions filter a page to empty.'=>'列出带有 ID、标题、别名和状态的本地对象的限定页面。仅返回可编辑的对象。在编辑之前读取确切对象及其字段架构。即使权限过滤将页面过滤为空，也请遵循 total_pages。','Read a verified native object with its editable settings and revision hash. Does not expose arbitrary post metadata. Custom field definitions are distinct from author profile values.'=>'读取经过验证的本地对象及其可编辑设置和修订哈希。不会暴露任意的帖子元数据。自定义字段定义与作者档案值不同。','Discover native editor labels, field types, supported choices and edition-specific fields. Optional id selects an existing object. Unknown or inactive-edition fields are rejected during saves.'=>'发现本地编辑器标签、字段类型、支持的选择和特定于版本的字段。可选的 id 选择现有对象。未知或非活动版本的字段在保存时会被拒绝。','Create a native object or patch a verified ID using discovered typed fields. New objects need a title and default to draft. Updates require expected_hash, preserve omitted fields and use native sanitizers. dry_run validates without saving. menu_order controls native list ordering. Managing custom field definitions requires Pro.'=>'使用发现的类型字段创建本地对象或修补经过验证的 ID。新对象需要一个标题，默认设置为草稿。更新需要 expected_hash，保留省略的字段并使用本地清理程序。dry_run 在不保存的情况下进行验证。menu_order 控制本地列表排序。管理自定义字段定义需要专业版。','Trash a verified native object with delete_post permission and expected_hash. Does not permanently delete it when Trash is disabled. Existing references are not rewritten. dry_run checks without deleting; custom field deletion requires Pro.'=>'删除经过验证的本地对象，需具备 delete_post 权限和 expected_hash。当垃圾箱被禁用时，不会永久删除。现有引用不会被重写。dry_run 在不删除的情况下进行检查；自定义字段删除需要专业版。','Field Type'=>'字段类型','Field Status'=>'字段状态','Required or optional'=>'必填或可选','Social Profile'=>'社交档案','Link relationship'=>'链接关系','Open link in a new tab'=>'在新标签页中打开链接','Show in REST API'=>'在 REST API 中显示','Description'=>'描述','Native object not found.'=>'未找到本地对象。','This object changed. Read it again before editing.'=>'此对象已更改。请在编辑之前再次读取。','A title is required for a new object.'=>'新对象需要一个标题。','You cannot create or publish this native object.'=>'您无法创建或发布此本地对象。','This field name is reserved for account identity or security.'=>'此字段名称保留用于账户身份或安全性。','Choose a unique author field slug.'=>'选择一个唯一的作者字段别名。','Choose discovered profile field names for the box order.'=>'选择发现的档案字段名称以确定框的顺序。','Choose a discovered template when creating a new Author Box.'=>'在创建新作者框时选择一个发现的模板。','The field order could not be saved. Read the object before retrying.'=>'字段顺序无法保存。在重试之前请读取对象。','Native metadata save failed; the original object was restored.'=>'本地元数据保存失败；原始对象已恢复。','Native metadata save failed and the original object could not be fully restored. Read it before retrying.'=>'本地元数据保存失败，且原始对象无法完全恢复。在重试之前请读取它。','This object changed. Read it again before deleting.'=>'此对象已更改。在删除之前请再次读取。','You cannot trash this object, or Trash is disabled.'=>'您无法删除此对象，或垃圾箱已禁用。','The native object could not be trashed.'=>'本地对象无法删除。','Discover author profile fields'=>'发现作者档案字段','Read native field labels, types and choices for an author. Enabled custom fields are included. Email, account identity, passwords and privileged user fields are excluded from profile fields; account linking has a separate action.'=>'读取作者的本地字段标签、类型和选择。启用的自定义字段包括在内。电子邮件、账户身份、密码和特权用户字段不包括在档案字段中；账户关联有单独的操作。','Read author profile details'=>'读取作者档案详细信息','Read an author profile, public native field values and a revision hash. Hidden REST fields, emails and arbitrary metadata are excluded. Use get-profile-fields before editing and the latest hash to update.'=>'读取作者档案、公共本地字段值和修订哈希。隐藏的 REST 字段、电子邮件和任意元数据不包括在内。在编辑之前请使用 get-profile-fields，并使用最新的哈希进行更新。','Create or update author profile'=>'创建或更新作者档案','Create a guest author, create a profile linked to an existing user_id, or patch an existing profile. Guest creation must be enabled. Discover native fields first; update requires expected_hash. Preserves omitted fields and respects linked-user permissions and administrator profile locks. dry_run validates without saving. Does not create WordPress accounts.'=>'创建一个访客作者，创建一个链接到现有 user_id 的个人资料，或修补现有的个人资料。必须启用访客创建。首先发现本地字段；更新需要 expected_hash。保留省略的字段，并尊重链接用户的权限和管理员个人资料锁。dry_run 验证而不保存。不会创建 WordPress 帐户。','Link or unlink an author user account'=>'链接或取消链接作者用户帐户','Link an existing author to an existing WordPress user, or use user_id 0 to unlink without deleting or changing the account. Requires the latest profile hash, edit_user on linked accounts, native mapping restrictions and administrator profile policy. dry_run previews without saving.'=>'将现有作者链接到现有 WordPress 用户，或使用 user_id 0 进行取消链接，而不删除或更改帐户。需要最新的个人资料哈希，链接帐户上的 edit_user，本地映射限制和管理员个人资料政策。dry_run 预览而不保存。','Delete an unassigned author profile'=>'删除未分配的作者个人资料','Delete a verified, unassigned author profile using native taxonomy permissions. Reassign existing posts first. Never deletes its linked WordPress account. Requires the latest profile hash; dry_run checks without deleting.'=>'使用本地 taxonomy 权限删除已验证的未分配作者个人资料。首先重新分配现有帖子。绝不会删除其链接的 WordPress 帐户。需要最新的个人资料哈希；dry_run 检查而不删除。','The author changed. Read the profile again before saving.'=>'作者已更改。在保存之前请重新阅读个人资料。','You cannot edit the linked user account.'=>'您无法编辑链接的用户帐户。','Editing other administrator profiles is disabled.'=>'禁用编辑其他管理员个人资料。','Choose an existing user for a new profile; use link-author-user to remap an existing author.'=>'为新个人资料选择一个现有用户；使用 link-author-user 重新映射现有作者。','This user already has an author profile.'=>'此用户已经有一个作者个人资料。','Choose an editable media attachment for the avatar.'=>'选择一个可编辑的媒体附件作为头像。','Guest author creation requires a name and must be enabled in Authors settings.'=>'创建访客作者需要一个名称，并且必须在作者设置中启用。','A linked author uses the WordPress account nicename as its slug.'=>'链接的作者使用 WordPress 帐户的 nicename 作为其 slug。','Choose a unique, non-empty author slug.'=>'选择一个唯一且非空的作者 slug。','Profile field save failed; the original state was restored.'=>'个人资料字段保存失败；恢复了原始状态。','Profile field save failed and restoration was incomplete. Read the profile before retrying.'=>'个人资料字段保存失败，恢复未完成。在重试之前请阅读个人资料。','The user is already mapped to another author.'=>'该用户已映射到另一位作者。','You cannot delete this author profile.'=>'您无法删除此作者个人资料。','Reassign posts before deleting this author profile.'=>'在删除此作者个人资料之前请重新分配帖子。','Could not delete the author profile.'=>'无法删除作者个人资料。','The settings could not be saved. Read them again before retrying.'=>'设置无法保存。在重试之前请再次阅读它们。','Read Authors settings'=>'阅读作者设置','Read typed General, Display, Author Pages, Guest Authors and Advanced settings, with defaults and native layout/role/post-type choices. Credentials and license keys are excluded. Whole-module switches use list-features and set-feature-enabled.'=>'读取输入的常规、显示、作者页面、访客作者和高级设置，包含默认值和本地布局/角色/帖子类型选择。凭据和许可证密钥被排除在外。整个模块开关使用 list-features 和 set-feature-enabled。','Update Authors settings'=>'更新作者设置','Patch only supplied Authors settings; preserves unrelated settings. Use get-plugin-settings for exact fields and native choices. dry_run validates and returns proposed values without saving. Author Pages changes refresh rewrite rules. Pro branding requires Pro.'=>'仅修补提供的作者设置；保留无关设置。使用 get-plugin-settings 获取确切字段和本地选择。dry_run 验证并返回建议值而不保存。作者页面更改会刷新重写规则。专业品牌需要 Pro。','Discover Authors features and actions'=>'发现作者功能和操作','List native Authors screens/modules, enabled state, permissions, edition and read/write workflows. Separate author profiles, post bylines, Author Boxes, Author Lists, Author Categories and Pro Custom Fields. Use field discovery before editing.'=>'列出本地作者屏幕/模块、启用状态、权限、编辑和读/写工作流。单独的作者个人资料、帖子版权、作者框、作者列表、作者类别和专业自定义字段。在编辑之前使用字段发现。','Enable or disable an Authors module'=>'启用或禁用作者模块','Change one discovered optional module switch. Autoloaded/core modules cannot be disabled. Does not change individual feature settings or author fields. dry_run previews without saving; refresh the MCP connection after enabling a module.'=>'更改一个发现的可选模块开关。自动加载/核心模块无法禁用。不会更改单个功能设置或作者字段。dry_run 预览而不保存；启用模块后刷新 MCP 连接。','Show Author Box below content'=>'在内容下方显示作者框','Show Author Box above content'=>'在内容上方显示作者框','Force empty author'=>'强制空作者','Username in search field'=>'搜索字段中的用户名','Enable plugin author pages'=>'启用插件作者页面','Show author pages bio'=>'显示作者页面简介','Show author post featured image'=>'显示作者帖子特色图像','Link author post featured image'=>'链接作者帖子特色图像','Show author post excerpt'=>'显示作者帖子摘录','Remove single user map restriction'=>'移除单个用户映射限制','Show author post authors'=>'显示作者帖子作者','Show author post date'=>'显示作者发帖日期','Show author post comments'=>'显示作者评论','Show author post category'=>'显示作者帖子分类','Show author post tags'=>'显示作者帖子标签','Show author post readmore'=>'显示作者更多阅读','Hide author pages empty posts message'=>'隐藏作者页面空帖子消息','Show author page title'=>'显示作者页面标题','Disable quick edit author box'=>'禁用快速编辑作者框','Enable font awesome'=>'启用 Font Awesome','Allow guest authors without a user account'=>'允许没有用户账户的访客作者','Author boxes opt out'=>'作者框选择退出','Allow author multiple categories'=>'允许作者多个分类','Allow guest authors with a user account'=>'允许有用户账户的访客作者','Show editor author box selection'=>'显示编辑器作者框选择','Default avatar decorative'=>'默认头像装饰性','Translate author taxonomy'=>'翻译作者分类','Allow administrators to edit other administrator profiles'=>'允许管理员编辑其他管理员的个人资料','Show email link in legacy Author Box'=>'在传统作者框中显示电子邮件链接','Show website link in legacy Author Box'=>'在传统作者框中显示网站链接','Legacy Author Box color scheme'=>'传统作者框配色方案','Choose a native Author Box layout ID or slug from discovery.'=>'从发现中选择一个本地作者框布局 ID 或别名。','List'=>'列表','Grid'=>'网格','Positive pixel size, or an empty string to use the native image size.'=>'正数像素大小，或为空字符串以使用本地图像大小。','Pro: display PublishPress branding.'=>'专业版：显示 PublishPress 品牌。','Roles available when mapping existing WordPress users to authors.'=>'将现有 WordPress 用户映射到作者时可用的角色。','Automatically create author profiles for new users in these roles.'=>'自动为这些角色的新用户创建作者个人资料。','Default author taxonomy term ID for new posts; zero uses native defaults.'=>'新帖子的默认作者分类术语 ID；零使用本地默认值。','Existing WordPress user ID used as the core post author for guest bylines.'=>'将现有 WordPress 用户 ID 用作访客署名的核心帖子作者。','Native guest account setting. MCP profile actions only link existing accounts and never create user accounts.'=>'本地访客账户设置。MCP 配置文件操作仅链接现有账户，而不会创建用户账户。','Posts per author page: -1 shows all posts; zero uses the native default of 10.'=>'每个作者页面的帖子数：-1 显示所有帖子；零使用本地默认值 10。','Use exact setting types from discovery.'=>'使用发现中的精确设置类型。','Role lists require role-name strings from discovery.'=>'角色列表需要来自发现的角色名称字符串。','Post type switches require true or false.'=>'帖子类型切换需要真或假。','This post type is enabled by site code and cannot be disabled here.'=>'此帖子类型由站点代码启用，无法在此禁用。','Choose an existing default author profile.'=>'选择一个现有的默认作者个人资料。','Choose an existing fallback user.'=>'选择一个现有的备用用户。','Choose a valid avatar URL.'=>'选择一个有效的头像 URL。','Native settings validation failed.'=>'本地设置验证失败。','Author Boxes'=>'作者框','Author Lists'=>'作者列表','Author Categories'=>'作者类别','Author field definitions'=>'作者字段定义','Settings, Author Pages and integrations'=>'设置、作者页面和集成','Author profiles'=>'作者资料','Ordered post bylines and per-post Author Box'=>'按顺序排列的帖子署名和每篇帖子作者框','Choose a discovered optional module.'=>'选择一个发现的可选模块。','Edit My Author Profile'=>'编辑我的作者资料','This name is used in several default displays and some search engine integrations.'=>'此名称用于多个默认显示和一些搜索引擎集成中。','This forms part of the URL for the author’s profile page. If you choose a Mapped User, this URL is taken from the user’s account and can not be changed.'=>'这是作者资料页面的 URL 的一部分。如果您选择了映射用户，此 URL 将来自用户的帐户，无法更改。','Search Authors'=>'搜索作者','Popular Authors'=>'热门作者','Parent Author'=>'父作者','Parent Author:'=>'父作者：','Edit Author'=>'编辑作者','View Author'=>'查看作者','Update Author'=>'更新作者','New Author Profile'=>'新作者资料','New Author'=>'新作者','Separate authors with commas'=>'用逗号分隔作者','Add or remove authors'=>'添加或删除作者','Choose from the most used Authors'=>'从最常用的作者中选择','Back to Authors'=>'返回作者','If you like %1$s please leave us a %2$s rating. Thank you!'=>'如果您喜欢 %1$s，请给我们留下 %2$s 评分。谢谢！','Posts'=>'帖子','Published posts of the following post types: %s'=>'以下帖子类型的已发布帖子：%s','Click on an author to change them. Drag to change their order.'=>'单击作者以更改他们。拖动以更改他们的顺序。','No co-author exists for that term'=>'该术语没有合著者','Edit'=>'编辑','Add Author'=>'添加作者','Are you sure you want to remove this author?'=>'您确定要删除此作者吗？','Click to change this author, or drag to change their position'=>'单击以更改此作者，或拖动以更改其位置','Click on an author to change them. Drag to change their order. Click on <strong>Remove</strong> to remove them.'=>'单击作者以更改他们。拖动以更改他们的顺序。单击 <strong>移除</strong> 以删除他们。','Are you sure you want to delete the authors profiles mapped to users? This action can\'t be undone.'=>'您确定要删除映射到用户的作者资料吗？此操作无法撤销。','Are you sure you want to delete the guest authors profiles? This action can\'t be undone.'=>'您确定要删除访客作者资料吗？此操作无法撤销。','Are you sure you want to create author profiles for the missed post authors?'=>'您确定要为缺失的帖子作者创建作者资料吗？','Are you sure you want to update the author column for all the posts?'=>'您确定要更新所有帖子的作者列吗？','Are you sure you want to update the author slug for all the users?'=>'您确定要更新所有用户的作者缩slug吗？','Are you sure you want to create authors for the selected roles?'=>'您确定要为