ation...'=>'正在收集迁移数据...','Error: '=>'错误: ','Done! Byline data was copied and you can deactivate the plugin.'=>'完成! 作者信息已被复制，您可以停用插件。','Copying authors\' data...'=>'正在复制作者的数据...','Deactivating Byline...'=>'正在停用作者信息...','Done! Byline is deactivated.'=>'完成! 作者信息已停用。','Deactivate Byline'=>'停用作者信息','Copy Byline Data'=>'复制作者信息','Migrate Bylines Data'=>'迁移作者信息','Add migration option for Bylines'=>'添加作者信息的迁移选项','Done! Bylines data was copied and you can deactivate the plugin.'=>'完成! 作者信息已被复制，您可以停用插件。','Deactivating Bylines...'=>'正在停用作者信息...','Done! Bylines is deactivated.'=>'完成! 作者信息已停用。','Deactivate Bylines'=>'停用作者信息','Copy Bylines Data'=>'复制作者信息','Debug'=>'调试','Add debug information for the plugin'=>'为插件添加调试信息','Authors Debug'=>'作者调试','Default Layouts'=>'默认布局','Divi Integration'=>'Divi 集成','Add compatibility with the Divi Theme Builder'=>'添加与 Divi 主题构建器的兼容性','Edit Flow Integration'=>'编辑流程集成','Add compatibility with the Edit Flow plugin'=>'添加与编辑流程插件的兼容性','Elementor Integration'=>'Elementor 集成','Add compatibility with the Elementor and Elementor Pro page builder'=>'添加与 Elementor 和 Elementor Pro 页面构建器的兼容性','Authors Box'=>'作者框','Choose one of the author boxes created under Authors > Author Boxes.'=>'选择在 作者 > 作者框 下创建的作者框之一。','Boxed (default)'=>'框架（默认）','Choose one of the author lists created under Authors > Author Lists.'=>'选择在 作者 > 作者列表 下创建的作者列表之一。','— No author lists found —'=>'— 未找到作者列表 —','Generatepress Integration'=>'GeneratePress 集成','Add compatibility with the Generatepress theme'=>'添加与 GeneratePress 主题的兼容性','Genesis Integration'=>'Genesis 集成','Add compatibility with the Genesis framework'=>'添加与 Genesis 框架的兼容性','Authors Settings'=>'作者设置','Features'=>'功能','Feel free to select only the features you need.'=>'请随意选择您需要的功能。','Enabled features'=>'已启用的功能','Recommendations for you'=>'为您推荐','Showcase your Authors with PublishPress Blocks'=>'通过 PublishPress Blocks 展示您的作者','PublishPress Blocks is a free plugin with full support for PublishPress Authors.'=>'PublishPress Blocks 是一个免费的插件，完全支持 PublishPress Authors。','Install this plugin to showcase content by your Authors.'=>'安装此插件以展示您的作者的内容。','Use the Content Display block to show your posts in many beautiful layouts.'=>'使用内容展示区块以多种美丽的布局展示您的帖子。','PublishPress Blocks has over 20 extra Gutenberg blocks including accordions, galleries, tables, and more.'=>'PublishPress Blocks 拥有超过 20 个额外的 Gutenberg 区块，包括手风琴、画廊、表格等。','Click here to install PublishPress Blocks'=>'点击这里安装 PublishPress Blocks','Migrate Molongui Data'=>'迁移 Molongui 数据','Add migration option for Molongui Authorship'=>'为 Molongui Authorship 添加迁移选项','Done! Molongui Authorship data was copied and you can deactivate the plugin.'=>'完成！Molongui Authorship 数据已复制，您可以停用该插件。','Migrating data...'=>'正在迁移数据...','Deactivating Molongui Authorship...'=>'正在停用 Molongui Authorship...','Done! Molongui Authorship is deactivated.'=>'完成！Molongui Authorship 被停用。','Deactivate Molongui Authorship'=>'停用 Molongui Authorship','Copy Molongui Authorship Data'=>'复制 Molongui Authorship 数据','This action will copy the authors from the plugin Molongui Authorship allowing you to migrate to PublishPress Authors without losing any data including post author relation. This action can be run multiple times.'=>'此操作将复制来自插件 Molongui Authorship 的作者，允许您迁移到 PublishPress Authors，而不会丢失任何数据，包括帖子作者关系。此操作可以多次执行。','It looks like you have Molongui Authorship installed.'=>'看起来您已经安装了 Molongui Authorship。','Please click here to migrate to PublishPress Authors'=>'请点击这里迁移到 PublishPress Authors','Dismiss'=>'忽略','Multiple Authors'=>'多个作者','Pages'=>'页面','PublishPress Authors Data'=>'PublishPress Authors 数据','Field'=>'字段','Separator'=>'分隔符','Use author archive page'=>'使用作者归档页面','Post ID'=>'帖子 ID','Optional. Load the authors for a specific post.'=>'可选。加载特定帖子的作者。','Author term ID'=>'作者术语 ID','Optional. Load a specific author by term ID.'=>'可选。通过术语 ID 加载特定作者。','Author categories'=>'作者分类','Optional. Comma-separated author category slugs.'=>'可选。以逗号分隔的作者分类别名。','Author Profile'=>'作者档案','Settings'=>'设置','Enable PublishPress Authors for these post types:'=>'为这些帖子类型启用 PublishPress Authors：','Post types to display on the author\'s profile page:'=>'在作者的档案页面上显示的帖子类型：','Roles available for Author Profiles:'=>'可用于作者档案的角色：','Automatically create author profiles:'=>'自动创建作者档案：','Show username in the search field:'=>'在搜索字段中显示用户名：','Default author for new posts:'=>'新帖子的默认作者：','Fallback user for Guest Authors:'=>'访客作者的后备用户：','Remove single author map restriction:'=>'移除单一作者地图限制：','Show above the content:'=>'显示在内容上方：','Show below the content:'=>'在内容下方显示：','Show Author Box selection:'=>'显示作者框选择：','Disable the "Authors" box when using "Quick Edit":'=>'使用“快速编辑”时禁用“作者”框：','Default Layout:'=>'默认布局：','Title for the author box:'=>'作者框标题：','Color scheme:'=>'配色方案：','Show email link:'=>'显示电子邮件链接：','Show site link:'=>'显示网站链接：','Font Awesome icons:'=>'Font Awesome 图标：','Enable author pages:'=>'启用作者页面：','Author pages posts limit:'=>'作者页面帖子限制：','Author pages layout:'=>'作者页面布局：','Grid layout column:'=>'网格布局列：','Show author bio:'=>'显示作者简介：','Author bio layout:'=>'作者简介布局：','Show author page title:'=>'显示作者页面标题：','Author pages excerpt ellipsis:'=>'作者页面摘录省略：','Author pages title header:'=>'作者页面标题头：','Author post title header:'=>'作者帖子标题头：','Show featured image:'=>'显示特色图片：','Link featured image to post:'=>'将特色图片链接到帖子：','Featured image custom width:'=>'特色图片自定义宽度：','Featured image custom height:'=>'特色图片自定义高度：','Show excerpt:'=>'显示摘录：','Show authors:'=>'显示作者：','Show post date:'=>'显示帖子日期：','Show comment counts:'=>'显示评论数量：','Show category:'=>'显示类别：','Show tags:'=>'显示标签：','Show read more link:'=>'显示“阅读更多”链接：','Hide empty posts message:'=>'隐藏空帖子消息：','Enable Guest Author With No User Account'=>'启用无用户账户的访客作者','Enable Guest Author With User Account'=>'启用有用户账户的访客作者','Allow users to opt out of Author Boxes'=>'允许用户选择不使用作者框','Allow authors in multiple categories:'=>'允许作者在多个类别中：','Allow administrators to edit administrator author profiles:'=>'允许管理员编辑管理员作者档案：','Boxed legacy layout Author Box:'=>'盒装传统布局作者框：','Centered legacy layout Author Box:'=>'居中传统布局作者框：','Inline legacy layout Author Box:'=>'行内传统布局作者框：','Inline avatar legacy layout Author Box:'=>'行内头像传统布局作者框：','Simple list legacy layout Author Box:'=>'简单列表遗留布局作者框：','Disabled because add_post_type_support(\'%1$s\', \'%2$s\') is included in a loaded file.'=>'已禁用，因为 add_post_type_support(\'%1$s\', \'%2$s\') 包含在已加载的文件中。','This will display the authors box at the top of the content.'=>'这将在内容顶部显示作者框。','This will display the authors box at the end of the content.'=>'这将在内容末尾显示作者框。','Allow users to choose which Author Box is used on each post.'=>'允许用户选择每篇文章使用哪个作者框。','Allow users with the "manage_options" capability to edit author profiles linked to administrator accounts. By default, editing administrator author profiles is blocked for security reasons.'=>'允许具有 "manage_options" 权限的用户编辑与管理员账户关联的作者资料。出于安全原因，默认情况下，编辑管理员作者资料是被阻止的。','Single'=>'单个','Plural'=>'复数','With this shortcode you can display the author box in any part of the content. '=>'使用此短代码，您可以在内容的任何部分显示作者框。','You can specify layout by using author boxes layout slug. You can see full details of each layout option %1$s in this guide %2$s.'=>'您可以通过使用作者框布局别名来指定布局。您可以在本指南 %2$s 中查看每个布局选项的完整详情 %1$s。','You can also decide whether or not to show the main title, using %1$s or %2$s .'=>'您还可以决定是否显示主标题，使用 %1$s 或 %2$s。','You can load the authors for a specific post, even if you are not in that post currently. For example, this shortcode will load the authors for the post with the ID of 32.'=>'您可以加载特定文章的作者，即使您当前不在该文章中。例如，此短代码将加载 ID 为 32 的文章的作者。','You can load the authors for a specific user by providing the user id. For example, this shortcode will load the author with user id of 32'=>'您可以通过提供用户 ID 加载特定用户的作者。例如，此短代码将加载用户 ID 为 32 的作者。','You can load the authors for a specific author by providing the author term id for both guest and user author. For example, this shortcode will load the author with term id of 32'=>'您可以通过提供作者术语 ID 加载特定作者的作者，无论是访客还是用户作者。例如，此短代码将加载术语 ID 为 32 的作者。','If you are having problems showing PublishPress Authors on author profile pages, you can use this shortcode below. The argument %s forces the plugin to retrieve the Author from the profile page and not any other posts on the same screen.'=>'如果您在作者资料页面上显示 PublishPress Authors 时遇到问题，可以使用下面的短代码。参数 %s 强制插件从资料页面获取作者，而不是同一屏幕上的其他文章。','There is one final option to mention. This is mostly useful if you\'re using a theme or page builder to customize the Author profile pages you find at URLs such as /author/username/. You can use the following shortcode on the authors page to display the profile of the current author. You just need to add the parameter %s.'=>'还有一个最终选项值得一提。这在您使用主题或页面构建器自定义您在 /author/username/ 等 URL 找到的作者资料页面时尤其有用。您可以在作者页面上使用以下短代码来显示当前作者的资料。您只需添加参数 %s。','You can load the authors belonging to a specific author categories by providing the category slug or slugs separated by comma for more than one category.'=>'您可以通过提供类别别名或以逗号分隔的多个类别别名，加载属于特定作者类别的作者。','Authors Data'=>'作者数据','With this shortcode you can display the author names or any profile field in any part of the content.'=>'使用此短代码，您可以在内容的任何部分显示作者姓名或任何资料字段。','The authors data shortcode accepts field parameter such as: %1$s %2$s %3$s %4$s %5$s %6$s %7$s. You can see full details and parameters %8$s in this guide %9$s.'=>'作者数据短代码接受字段参数，例如：%1$s %2$s %3$s %4$s %5$s %6$s %7$s。您可以在本指南 %9$s 中查看完整的详细信息和参数 %8$s。','You can also specify the separator to be used for mulitple authors data.'=>'您还可以指定用于多个作者数据的分隔符。','You can retrieve a specific author by providing the author\'s term ID. For example, this shortcode will load the author with the term ID of 102.'=>'您可以通过提供作者的术语 ID 来检索特定作者。例如，此短代码将加载术语 ID 为 102 的作者。','You can also decide to return an array list of authors by using user_objects="true" which will return all the authors object data as an array. You can check full details and sample usage %2$s in this guide%3$s.'=>'您还可以决定通过使用 user_objects="true" 返回作者的数组列表，这将返回所有作者对象数据作为数组。您可以在本指南 %3$s 中查看完整详情和示例用法 %2$s。','You can retrieve authors belonging to a specific Author Category by providing the category slug or slugs. Separate multiple slugs with a comma.'=>'您可以通过提供类别别名或别名，检索属于特定作者类别的作者。用逗号分隔多个别名。','With this shortcode, you can show all the authors together in a single display.'=>'使用此短代码，您可以将所有作者一起显示在单一显示中。','You can specify layout by using author boxes layout slug. You can see full details of each layout option %1$s in this guide %2$s. %3$s %4$s This shortcode also provides four custom layouts: %5$s %6$s %7$s %8$s.'=>'您可以通过使用作者框布局别名来指定布局。您可以在本指南 %2$s 中查看每个布局选项的完整详情 %1$s。 %3$s %4$s 此短代码还提供四种自定义布局：%5$s %6$s %7$s %8$s。','You can define the number of layout columns by using %1$s to show authors in 2 column.'=>'您可以通过使用 %1$s 定义布局列数，以便以 2 列显示作者。','You can show authors in a card grid by using %1$s, choose the number of grid columns with %2$s, and choose author fields with %3$s .'=>'您可以通过使用 %1$s 在卡片网格中显示作者，使用 %2$s 选择网格列数，并使用 %3$s 选择作者字段。','You can show authors in a table by using %1$s and choose author fields with %2$s .'=>'您可以通过使用 %1$s 在表格中显示作者，并使用 %2$s 选择作者字段。','You can choose the number of authors per page using %1$s . %2$s Pagination will be automatically added if required.'=>'您可以使用 %1$s 选择每页显示的作者数量。 %2$s 如果需要，将自动添加分页。','You can limit the result to only authors who are assigned to posts by using %1$s . %2$s Alternatively, use %3$s to show all authors, including those without any posts.'=>'您可以使用 %1$s 限制结果仅显示已分配给文章的作者。 %2$s 或者，使用 %3$s 显示所有作者，包括没有任何文章的作者。','You can limit the result to only guest authors by using %1$s . %2$s Alternatively, %3$s will show only authors with a WordPress account.'=>'您可以使用 %1$s 限制结果仅显示访客作者。 %2$s 或者，使用 %3$s 将仅显示具有 WordPress 账户的作者。','If you are using the authors_recent layout, you can define the number of columns by using %1$s .'=>'如果您使用的是 authors_recent 布局，可以使用 %1$s 定义列数。','For authors_index layout, you can group user by profile field by using %1$s .'=>'对于 authors_index 布局，您可以使用 %1$s 按个人资料字段对用户进行分组。','To order the results based on post count, use %1$s . To order the results by name, use %2$s . Alternatively, you can order by profile fields like %3$s, %4$s etc'=>'要根据文章数量对结果进行排序，请使用 %1$s。要按名称对结果进行排序，请使用 %2$s。或者，您可以按个人资料字段进行排序，如 %3$s、%4$s 等。','To further customize the order of results, use %1$s or %2$s .'=>'要进一步自定义结果的顺序，请使用 %1$s 或 %2$s。','To display a search box for authors, use %1$s .'=>'要显示作者的搜索框，请使用 %1$s。','You can also show a dropdown menu that allows users to search on specific author fields. You can add fields to the dropdown using %1$s . This requires the search box to be active.'=>'您还可以显示一个下拉菜单，允许用户在特定的作者字段上进行搜索。您可以使用 %1$s 将字段添加到下拉菜单中。这需要搜索框处于活动状态。','You can limit the author list to users with a published post within a specific period using %1$s . This accept english date value like 1 week ago, 1 month ago, 6 months ago, 1 year ago etc.'=>'您可以使用 %1$s 限制作者列表，仅限在特定时间段内发布文章的用户。此参数接受英文日期值，例如 1 周前、1 个月前、6 个月前、1 年前等。','Copy shortcode to clipboard'=>'将短代码复制到剪贴板','Copied!'=>'已复制！','Click To Copy!'=>'点击复制！','Select roles'=>'选择角色','Choose which WordPress user roles can be selected using the "Registered Author With User Account" option for author profiles.'=>'选择可以使用“带用户帐户的注册作者”选项来选择的WordPress用户角色，用于作者资料。','Author profiles can be mapped to WordPress user accounts. This option allows you to automatically create author profiles when users are created in these roles. You can also do this for existing users by clicking the "Create PublishPress Authors Profiles for all users in a role" button in the Maintenance tab.'=>'作者资料可以映射到WordPress用户帐户。此选项允许您在创建用户时自动创建作者资料。您还可以通过单击维护选项卡中的“为角色中所有用户创建PublishPress作者资料”按钮来为现有用户执行此操作。','If the Author is mapped to a WordPress user, this will display the authors\' "Display name" and their "Username". The default is to show only the "Display name". Showing the "Username" is useful if you have several authors with similar names.'=>'如果作者映射到WordPress用户，则将显示作者的“显示名称”和“用户名”。默认情况下，仅显示“显示名称”。如果您有多个名字相似的作者，显示“用户名”是很有用的。','Allow authors to be created without a real user account.'=>'允许创建没有真实用户帐户的作者。','Show a profile checkbox allowing Authors to be excluded from Author Boxes.'=>'显示一个复选框，允许作者从作者框中排除。','Allow authors to be created without a connected user account.'=>'允许创建没有连接的用户帐户的作者。','If enabled, PublishPress Authors will replace the default WordPress author pages.'=>'如果启用，PublishPress作者将替代默认的WordPress作者页面。','Please note this feature will not work for all themes.'=>'请注意，此功能并不适用于所有主题。','Click here for more details.'=>'点击这里以获取更多详细信息。','View sample Author Page'=>'查看示例作者页面','Allow User to Choose'=>'允许用户选择','First Name Last Name'=>'名 姓','Last Name First Name'=>'姓 名','Describe the default avatar. Leave blank to use its Media Library alternative text.'=>'描述默认头像。留空以使用其媒体库替代文本。','This image is decorative'=>'此图像为装饰性图像','This avatar will be used if no custom avatar is uploaded for an author profile.'=>'如果没有为作者资料上传自定义头像，则将使用此头像。','This will display the author bio.'=>'这将显示作者简介。','Select option'=>'选择选项','This is useful if you use legacy shortcode %s'=>'如果您使用遗留短代码 %s，这将很有用','This will display the featured image.'=>'这将显示特色图像。','This will make the featured image clickable and link to the post.'=>'这将使特色图像可点击并链接到文章。','This will display author page title.'=>'这将显示作者页面标题。','This will display the excerpt.'=>'这将显示摘要。','This will allows you map a WordPress user to more than one author. Don\'t use this feature unless requested to do so by the PublishPress team. This plugin works better when authors and users are paired one-to-one.'=>'这将允许您将一个WordPress用户映射到多个作者。除非PublishPress团队要求，否则请勿使用此功能。此插件在作者和用户一对一配对时效果更好。','Allow the same author to be assigned to more than one Author Category on a single post.'=>'允许同一作者被分配到单个文章的多个作者类别。','This will display the authors.'=>'这将显示作者。','This will display the published date.'=>'这将显示发布日期。','This will display the comment count.'=>'这将显示评论数。','This will display the categories.'=>'这将显示类别。','This will display the tags.'=>'这将显示标签。','This will display the read more link.'=>'这将显示“阅读更多”链接。','This will hide the "Post not found for the author" text when an author has no posts.'=>'当作者没有文章时，这将隐藏“未找到该作者的文章”文本。','This setting may be disabled for users who can not edit others posts.'=>'此设置可能会对无法编辑他人文章的用户禁用。','Search for a fallback author'=>'搜索备用作者','If you only have Guest Authors selected for a post, this user may be used as a fallback. WordPress sometimes requires a WordPress user to be assigned to each post. This user will not be visible on the front of your site.'=>'如果您仅为一篇文章选择了访客作者，则可以将此用户用作备用。WordPress有时要求每篇文章分配一个WordPress用户。此用户在您网站的前端将不可见。','This will display the authors email in the author box.'=>'这将显示作者框中的作者电子邮件。','This will display the authors site in the author box.'=>'这将显示作者框中的作者网站。','This will load Font Awesome icons for use in Author Boxes.'=>'这将加载 Font Awesome 图标以用于作者框。','This will remove the Authors Box in "Quick Edit".'=>'这将删除“快速编辑”中的作者框。','Create PublishPress Authors Profiles for all post authors'=>'为所有帖子作者创建 PublishPress 作者档案','If a WordPress user is the author of a post, but does not have a PublishPress Authors profile, this will automatically create a profile for them.'=>'如果 WordPress 用户是帖子的作者，但没有 PublishPress 作者档案，则将自动为他们创建档案。','Click here for documentation'=>'点击此处查看文档','Create missing PublishPress Authors profiles'=>'创建缺失的 PublishPress 作者档案','Create PublishPress Authors Profiles for all users in a role'=>'为角色中的所有用户创建 PublishPress 作者档案','This will find all the users in a role and create author profiles for them. You can choose the roles using the "Automatically create author profiles" setting.'=>'这将找到角色中的所有用户并为他们创建作者档案。您可以使用“自动创建作者档案”设置选择角色。','Create PublishPress Authors profiles'=>'创建 PublishPress 作者档案','Synchronize PublishPress Authors Fields and user profile fields'=>'同步 PublishPress 作者字段和用户档案字段','This will update all the author profiles in PublishPress Authors to match the default WordPress fields for each user.'=>'这将更新所有 PublishPress 作者中的作者档案，以匹配每个用户的默认 WordPress 字段。','Synchronize the author and user URLs'=>'同步作者和用户的 URL','This will update all the Author URLs in PublishPress Authors to match the default WordPress URLs for each user.'=>'这将更新 PublishPress 作者中的所有作者 URL，以匹配每个用户的默认 WordPress URL。','Create Author Categories'=>'创建作者分类','This will create author categories table if missing and add default categories.'=>'如果缺失，这将创建作者分类表并添加默认分类。','Copy Co-Authors Plus Data'=>'复制 Co-Authors Plus 数据','This action will copy the authors from the plugin Co-Authors Plus allowing you to migrate to PublishPress Authors without losing any data. This action can be run multiple times.'=>'此操作将复制插件 Co-Authors Plus 中的作者，允许您迁移到 PublishPress 作者而不会丢失任何数据。此操作可以多次运行。','Delete Connections Between Author Profiles and Users'=>'删除作者档案与用户之间的连接','This action can reset the PublishPress Authors data before using other maintenance options. It will delete all author profiles that are mapped to a WordPress user account. This will not delete the WordPress user accounts, but any links between the posts and author profiles will be lost.'=>'此操作可以在使用其他维护选项之前重置 PublishPress 作者数据。它将删除所有映射到 WordPress 用户帐户的作者档案。此操作不会删除 WordPress 用户帐户，但帖子与作者档案之间的任何链接将丢失。','Delete all authors mapped to users'=>'删除所有映射到用户的作者','Delete Guest Authors'=>'删除访客作者','This action can reset the PublishPress Authors data before using other maintenance options. Guest authors are author profiles that are not mapped to a WordPress user account. This action will delete all guest authors.'=>'此操作可以在使用其他维护选项之前重置 PublishPress 作者数据。访客作者是未映射到 WordPress 用户帐户的作者档案。此操作将删除所有访客作者。','Delete all guest authors'=>'删除所有访客作者','Please be careful clicking these buttons. Before clicking, we recommend taking a site backup in case anything goes wrong.'=>'请小心点击这些按钮。在点击之前，我们建议进行网站备份，以防出现问题。','Author Profiles'=>'作者档案','Integration'=>'集成','Maintenance'=>'维护','Advanced'=>'高级','Invalid nonce'=>'无效的 nonce','Access denied'=>'拒绝访问','Error. Author terms could not be reseted.'=>'错误。无法重置作者条款。','Maintenance completed successfully.'=>'维护成功完成。','Collecting data...'=>'正在收集数据...','Finishing the process...'=>'正在完成过程...','Done! %d posts were updated.'=>'完成！%d 个帖子已更新。','Updating author field on posts...'=>'正在更新帖子的作者字段...','Updated %1$d of %2$d posts...'=>'已更新 %1$d 个中的 %2$d 个帖子...','Sync author and user URLs'=>'同步作者和用户 URL','Done! %d authors were updated.'=>'完成！%d 个作者已更新。','Updating authors slug...'=>'正在更新作者 slug...','Updated %1$d of %2$d authors...'=>'更新了 %1$d 个 %2$d 位作者...','Creating missed post authors....'=>'正在创建缺失的帖子作者....','Copy Co-Authors Plus data'=>'复制 Co-Authors Plus 数据','Deactivating Co-uthors Plus...'=>'正在停用 Co-Authors Plus...','Done! Co-Authors Plus is deactivated.'=>'完成！Co-Authors Plus 已被停用。','Deactivate Co-Authors Plus'=>'停用 Co-Authors Plus','Done! Co-Authors Plus data was copied.'=>'完成！Co-Authors Plus 数据已被复制。','It looks like you have Co-Authors Plus installed.'=>'看起来您已经安装了 Co-Authors Plus。','Please click here and read this guide!'=>'请点击此处并阅读此指南！','PublishPress Authors could not complete the background database update for Permissions integration.'=>'PublishPress Authors 无法完成权限集成的后台数据库更新。','PublishPress Authors is waiting to complete the background database update for Permissions integration.'=>'PublishPress Authors 正在等待完成权限集成的后台数据库更新。','Run the update manually'=>'手动运行更新','Guest Author cannot login on the site.'=>'访客作者无法登录网站。','Polylang Integration'=>'Polylang 集成','Enable Polylang Author Translation:'=>'启用 Polylang 作者翻译：','Enable translation of author profiles in Polylang.'=>'启用 Polylang 中作者资料的翻译。','Rank Math Seo Integration'=>'Rank Math SEO 集成','Add compatibility with the Rank Math Seo plugin'=>'与 Rank Math SEO 插件兼容','Rest API'=>'REST API','Rest API support'=>'REST API 支持','Guest authors without user accounts is not enabled.'=>'未启用无用户账户的访客作者。','Guest author with user accounts is not enabled.'=>'未启用有用户账户的访客作者。','An author with this slug already exists.'=>'已经存在具有此 slug 的作者。','This WordPress user is already mapped to another author.'=>'此 WordPress 用户已映射到另一个作者。','Author was created but could not be retrieved.'=>'作者已创建但无法检索。','You cannot edit author mapped to administrator account.'=>'您无法编辑映射到管理员账户的作者。','You do not have permission to edit this author.'=>'您没有权限编辑此作者。','Reviews'=>'评论','